# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Production RAG — Environment Variables Template
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env

# ─── AI Provider Priority: Google → Local → Anthropic → OpenAI ───
# Provider 1 — Google Gemini (PRIMARY)
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here
GOOGLE_LLM_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash
# Comma-separated cascade of Google models to try on rate-limit (best first).
# If omitted, uses built-in default: Flash 3.6→3.5→3.0→2.5, then Lite 3.5→3.1→2.5
GOOGLE_MODEL_CASCADE=gemini-3.6-flash,gemini-3.5-flash,gemini-3.0-flash,gemini-2.5-flash,gemini-3.5-flash-lite,gemini-3.1-flash-lite,gemini-2.5-flash-lite

# Provider 2 — Local LLM via Ollama (SECONDARY)
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
LOCAL_LLM_MODEL=llama3.2

# Provider 3 — Anthropic Claude (TERTIARY)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here
ANTHROPIC_LLM_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5

# Provider 4 — OpenAI (LAST RESORT)
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
OPENAI_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o

# ── LangSmith Observability ─────────────────────────────────────
LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2=true
LANGCHAIN_ENDPOINT=https://api.smith.langchain.com
LANGCHAIN_API_KEY=your_langsmith_api_key_here
LANGCHAIN_PROJECT=production-rag-project

# ── Supabase (Production Vector DB) ─────────────────────────────
SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_project_url
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_key
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/dbname

# ── App Configuration ───────────────────────────────────────────
ENVIRONMENT=development
CHROMA_PERSIST_DIRECTORY=./chroma_db
COLLECTION_NAME=production_rag_docs
EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o
MAX_TOKENS=1000
CHUNK_SIZE=1000
CHUNK_OVERLAP=200

# ── Security ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
API_SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key_here
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8501
